r` call it:","+*Choose the engine.* Configure it once under `engines` and name it here; every default parser","+stays loaded, and `image-parser` and `pdf-parser` call it:"," "," [source,json]"," ----"," {","+  \"engines\": {","+    \"tesseract\": { \"tesseract-ocr-parser\": { \"language\": \"eng\" } }","+  },","   \"text-recognizers\": [","-    { \"tesseract-ocr-parser\": { \"language\": \"eng\" } }","+    { \"engine\": \"tesseract\" }","   ]"," }"," ----"," ","+An entry naming an engine takes only `engine`, `_mime-include` and `_mime-exclude`; the engine's","+own settings live under `engines`, where an","+xref:configuration/inference.adoc[inference binding] can name the same engine. The 4.0 form,","+the engine inline, still works: `{ \"tesseract-ocr-parser\": { \"language\": \"eng\" } }`.","+"," *Turn OCR off.* An empty list is authoritative:"," "," [source,json]","@@ -152,7 +160,7 @@ on an embedded image or a rendered PDF page, a VLM prompted to transcribe. A con"," { \"text-recognizers\": [] }"," ----"," ","-Engine names: `tesseract-ocr-parser`, `tess4j-parser`, `openai-vlm-parser`, `claude-vlm-parser`,","+Engine types: `tesseract-ocr-parser`, `tess4j-parser`, `openai-vlm-parser`, `claude-vlm-parser`,"," `gemini-vlm-parser`. At startup Tika logs one line per engine with the media types it enriches, so"," the effective engine is never a guess."," "],"additions":12,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/modules/ROOT/pages/configuration/inference.adoc","lines":["@@ -43,6 +43,12 @@ different models. Secrets and paths live here and only here."," `maxBatchSize` images per request. Options: `baseUrl`, `model`, `apiKey`, `timeoutMillis`"," (120000), `maxBatchSize` (32), `embeddingsPath`, `apiKeyHeaderName`, `apiKeyPrefix`."," ","+A text recognizer is an engine too: `\"tesseract\": { \"tesseract-ocr-parser\": { \"language\": \"eng\" } }`","+here, and `{ \"engine\": \"tesseract\" }` in","+xref:configuration/index.adoc#text-recognizers[`text-recognizers`], so an OCR